Now note that the entire shaded region is just 6 times this part:
<asy> size(100);
fill((2,sqrt(3))--(2.5,3sqrt(3)/2)--(2,2sqrt(3))--(1.5,3sqrt(3)/2)--cycle,gray(0.4));
fill(arc((2,2sqrt(3)),1,240,300)--(2,2sqrt(3))--cycle,white); 
