==Solution 4 (Variables)==

We can set several variables.

Let <math>x</math> be the area of the shaded region, and let <math>y</math> be the area of one of the 'leaf-shaped' regions.

<asy>
size(140);
fill((1,0)--(3,0)--(4,sqrt(3))--(3,2sqrt(3))--(1,2sqrt(3))--(0,sqrt(3))--cycle,gray(0.4));
